flowchart TD
    A[PDF Resume]
    --> B["PyMuPDF: Extract text spans + metadata"]

    B --> C["Area Validation
    Check text coordinates against valid page area"]

    C --> D{Inside valid area?}

    D -->|No| X1[Discard text span]
    D -->|Yes| E["Visibility Validation
    • text/background contrast
    • opacity
    • render mode
    • rendered visibility"]

    E --> F{Visible?}

    F -->|No| X2[Discard text span]
    F -->|Yes| G[Trusted Visible Text]

    G --> H["LLM: Parse resume into structured fields"]

    H --> I["Pydantic Validation
    • schema
    • field types
    • required fields
    • value constraints"]

    I --> J{Valid?}

    J -->|No| X3[Reject / Retry LLM Output]
    J -->|Yes| K[Final Parsed Resume Fields]